the five ways are as follows:

Avoid throwing out food and other waste products;

Eat less, cook, and eat-in;

Eat in more;

Purchase and consume less food;

Buy/consume/use fewer and better-quality things.

The second rule of the frugal diet is “frugal” which is simply doing things that are frugal. If you are in the business of doing things that are a waste of money, your frugality can also be a waste of money.

